core gamers with an interest in games that are easy to learn but difficult to master.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulties for all skill levels and ages.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you have never picked up a ball-roller before, or have been doing it all your life, BallBastic! has 185 levels across the spectrum ranging from the breezy tutorial to the brutal Expert mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like the starter levels are<i> too</i>\u00a0easy? Up the ante with Survival Mode, where just one death ends your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Push Your Speed to Its Limits!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/54428cb457413d30bbc1fba3f777872b.poster.avif?t=1764650840\" width=672 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/54428cb457413d30bbc1fba3f777872b.webm?t=1764650840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/54428cb457413d30bbc1fba3f777872b.mp4?t=1764650840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources on Orbulon such as Trampolines and Speeders can be your best friends...or your worst enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Forge Your Own Path</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think within the box...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/6aceefa726dd88deab923ea7db910820.poster.avif?t=1764650840\" width=670 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/6aceefa726dd88deab923ea7db910820.webm?t=1764650840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/6aceefa726dd88deab923ea7db910820.mp4?t=1764650840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...or disregard it entirely!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/0d5f1244541603258bc0e61164e44196.poster.avif?t=1764650840\" width=670 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/0d5f1244541603258bc0e61164e44196.webm?t=1764650840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/0d5f1244541603258bc0e61164e44196.mp4?t=1764650840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pure, Instant Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No replays, no cutscenes. Whether you win or lose, you immediately get back into the action, never interrupting the flow-state of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/5ad82980d1735c7589a2ec0adf211cdb.poster.avif?t=1764650840\" width=670 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/5ad82980d1735c7589a2ec0adf211cdb.webm?t=1764650840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/5ad82980d1735c7589a2ec0adf211cdb.mp4?t=1764650840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel through harder-to-reach warps to skip levels!  </strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mute